Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?feat(vo2):=20a=20measured=20VO=E2=82=82max=20re?=
 =?UTF-8?q?aches=20Health=20and=20the=20coach?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A VO₂max a watch or test measured (Health Connect / Apple Health daily rows) was only
on Compare and the Apple Health screen. One resolver, VictorCoachVitals.measuredVo2max
(newest of either source within a year), now feeds the coach (told apart from the
estimate, and preferred) and Health's Fitness Age card (a 'Measured: N · day' line under
the estimate). The estimate and the fitness age derived from it are unchanged.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
