+                "VO₂max MEASURED by a watch or test (Health Connect): 49 ml/kg/min (2026-10-02); prefer it over the estimate",
+            VictorCoachVitals.fitnessLine("2026-10-14" to 45.6, null, "2026-10-02" to 48.8),
